+`PUT .../members` changes member roles (`manager`/`contributor`/`viewer`) in bulk and is
+all-or-nothing: an invalid role, a non-member, an empty request, or a result with no
+manager left → 400 and nothing changes. Only project managers may call it (others who can read → 403;
+archived → 409).
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
